# Public Gateway - Caddy Reverse Proxy
# Two-Box Architecture: VPS-LOCAL services only.
# Host: virtual-tunnel-vnic | Public IP: 147.224.179.179 | Tailscale: 100.67.166.50
#
# RULE: Hardware-direct services (HA, Proxmox, TrueNAS, unRAID, Frigate, etc.)
#       use Cloudflare Tunnel — they do NOT belong here.
#
# DNS: A records for all entries below → 147.224.179.179
#      Use Cloudflare DNS-only (gray cloud) so Caddy handles TLS via ACME.

# ── Dashboard (Heimdall) ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
dash.aadd.rocks {
	reverse_proxy localhost:8080
}

